    'high-confidence learning record preservation' => 'Conservation d \'Archives d\' apprentissage haute confiance',
    'really save personal learning records such as cbt(computer based test) and online learning, so that personal learning records are true and credible.' => 'Les dossiers d\'études individuels, tels que ceux du CBT (computer - based Test) et de l\'apprentissage en ligne, sont effectivement conservés, ce qui permet d\'en assurer la fiabilité.',
