    'ipg program document requirements' => 'IPG descriptifs de projet',
    'requirements:' => 'Demande:',
    'a copy of the letter stating that you have successfully completed the pharmacy examining board of canada (pebc) evaluating examination.' => 'Copie de la lettre attestant que vous avez réussi l \'examen d\' évaluation de la Commission canadienne d \'examen de pharmacie (PeBC).',
